# cabin_moon_3: the moon at a waxing gibbous (3 eighths of its month), lit on the right while waxing
# (lead call 54). Lamp light (24), so it stays bright at night; the dark
# limb isn't drawn, the sky shows there. Two slate seas. The anchor, 0,0, is the
# disc's center (at_moon). 7 wide, 7 tall.
C 24  L -1,-3 1,-3  L -2,-2 0,-2  L 2,-2  L -2,-1  L 0,-1 3,-1  L -2,0 3,0
      L -2,1 -1,1  L 1,1 3,1  L -2,2 2,2  L -1,3 1,3
C 2  L 1,-2  L -1,-1  L 0,1
